Admittedly, I used the save and restore bit to get the weapon (along
with several blessed magic markers and a few scrolls of charging). 
However, what I don't think most people realize is that unlike armor
enchantment, the chance for weapon enchantment does not go down as the
enchantment goes up.  It is a flat chance (something like 1/3 per extra
plus...I forget, it has been a while).  So, eventually, that blessed
scroll of enchant weapon will not dissolve your weapon.  I decided to
see how high I could get the weapon.  +49 is how high I got, but there
is no theoretical maximum (I think).

